    "text": "The Beacon's completion moved from June 2004 to 'built 2003' as listed by SFHighrises (a listing site, not a primary source; the month had no source). Lucky Strike's 2012 opening is now described as announced for March 9, 2012 (InPark Magazine and 7x7 are pre-opening pieces), its opened date is blank, and its status rests on Lucky Strike's own location page; InPark places it on the ground floor of the Beacon. The Safeway and AT&T addresses are marked as Pier & Point's own assignment to The Beacon, since their sources do not name it. The map notes now set out what the listing sites do and do not say about units, developer and the conflicting architect credits.",
